GLOBAL LANDING_COAST_MCC_PULSE_TIME IS 0.25.
GLOBAL LANDING_COAST_MCC_SETTLE_TIME IS 2.
GLOBAL LANDING_COAST_MCC_ALIGN_DEG IS 5.
GLOBAL LANDING_COAST_MCC_MAX_UP_DOT IS 0.1.
GLOBAL LANDING_COAST_MCC_CLIMB_LIMIT IS 5.
