GLOBAL CROSS_PID_MAX IS 15.
GLOBAL TERMINAL_HSPEED IS 1.
GLOBAL TERMINAL_ALT IS 1000.
GLOBAL BRAKE_ACCEL_FRACTION IS 1.0.
GLOBAL BRAKE_MARGIN IS 500.
